{"id":"ae8d32923d636465","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic.md","title":"ZFC LC Compactness Cardinal Logic","display":"df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic — ZFC LC Compactness Cardinal Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic"],"display":"df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic — ZFC LC Compactness Cardinal Logic","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic — ZFC LC Compactness Cardinal Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是逻辑的元理论类编码：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\">\\(\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\\)</span> 标记句子码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle1,M\\rangle\">\\(\\langle1,M\\rangle\\)</span> 标记模型码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span> 标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span>。每个句子和每个模型码是集合，句子类及模型类不必是集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是下式由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 唯一确定的类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(T)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,S,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,S,A)\\)</span> 的第二、第三个参数为类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcCompactnessCardinalLogic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcCompactnessCardinalLogic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 保留原接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq S\">\\(T\\subseteq S\\)</span> 的量化始终指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in V\">\\(T\\in V\\)</span> 的集合理论，不量化真类理论。本文件只取抽象逻辑已给定的句子、模型、真关系部分，不增加逻辑算子的额外公理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in V:\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in V:\\langle1,M\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{T\\in V:T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\land\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\forall\\phi\\in T\\;\n\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in V:\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in V:\\langle1,M\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{T\\in V:T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\land\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\forall\\phi\\in T\\;\n\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,S,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land A=\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal L\\;\\bigl(\n\\exists\\phi\\in S\\;z=\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\n\\lor\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;z=\\langle1,M\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\lor\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\phi\\in S\\;z=\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,S,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nS=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land A=\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal L\\;\\bigl(\n\\exists\\phi\\in S\\;z=\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\n\\lor\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;z=\\langle1,M\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{34mm}\\lor\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\phi\\in S\\;z=\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcCompactnessCardinalLogic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\in V\\;\\bigl(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\n[(\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;(|T_0|&lt;\\kappa\\to T_0\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}))\\to T\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}]\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcCompactnessCardinalLogic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall T\\in V\\;\\bigl(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\n[(\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;(|T_0|&lt;\\kappa\\to T_0\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}))\\to T\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}]\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将逻辑的语义数据本身编码为带标签的类，并从其真关系定义理论可满足性；保留原来的任意抽象逻辑紧致性，而不偷换成一阶逻辑或拓扑紧致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Cardinal}$ 取 [[58-df-cardinal]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle1,M\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,S,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcCompactnessCardinalLogic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{\\phi\\in V:\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in V:\\langle1,M\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\coloneqq\\{T\\in V:T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\n\\land\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\forall\\phi\\in T\\;\n\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\in\\mathcal L\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,S,A)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nS=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land A=\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall z\\in\\mathcal L\\;\\bigl(\n\\exists\\phi\\in S\\;z=\\langle0,\\phi\\rangle\n\\lor\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;z=\\langle1,M\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{34mm}\\lor\\exists M\\in\\operatorname{Mod}_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\exists\\phi\\in S\\;z=\\langle2,\\langle M,\\phi\\rangle\\rangle\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcCompactnessCardinalLogic}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{AbstractLogicData}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L},\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall T\\in V\\;\\bigl(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\n[(\\forall T_0\\subseteq T\\;(|T_0|<\\kappa\\to T_0\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}))\\to T\\in\\mathrm{Sat}_{\\mathcal L}]\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3034,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2443","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic.md|58-df-zfc-lc-compactness-cardinal-logic]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}